@baseUrl = http://localhost:10000
@locationId = Prague
@drawDate = 2026-05-26
@timeSlotStart = 2026-05-26T08:00:00
@timeSlotEnd = 2026-05-26T18:00:00

# These requests intentionally omit auth headers so no credential-like values are
# committed. Add the correct local auth header in VS Code REST Client before
# sending each request: employee for employee scenarios, HR for HR scenarios,
# admin for lifecycle/admin scenarios.

### 1. Employee creates a future booking request that waits for Draw
POST {{baseUrl}}/bookings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestedDate": "{{drawDate}}",
  "plannedArrivalTime": "{{timeSlotStart}}",
  "plannedDepartureTime": "{{timeSlotEnd}}",
  "vehicleId": "vehicle-employee1-default"
}

### 2. Employee cannot trigger Draw
POST {{baseUrl}}/draws/trigger
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "locationId": "{{locationId}}",
  "date": "{{drawDate}}",
  "timeSlotStart": "{{timeSlotStart}}",
  "timeSlotEnd": "{{timeSlotEnd}}",
  "reason": "Employee must not be allowed to run Draw"
}

### 3. HR sees pre-Draw status
GET {{baseUrl}}/draws/{{drawDate}}/status?locationId={{locationId}}&timeSlotStart={{timeSlotStart}}&timeSlotEnd={{timeSlotEnd}}

### 4. HR runs Draw on demand
POST {{baseUrl}}/draws/trigger
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "locationId": "{{locationId}}",
  "date": "{{drawDate}}",
  "timeSlotStart": "{{timeSlotStart}}",
  "timeSlotEnd": "{{timeSlotEnd}}",
  "reason": "REST Client smoke: HR on-demand Draw"
}

### 5. HR reruns the same Draw key and receives existing completed result
POST {{baseUrl}}/draws/trigger
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "locationId": "{{locationId}}",
  "date": "{{drawDate}}",
  "timeSlotStart": "{{timeSlotStart}}",
  "timeSlotEnd": "{{timeSlotEnd}}",
  "reason": "REST Client smoke: idempotency check"
}

### 6. Employee sees post-Draw status
GET {{baseUrl}}/draws/{{drawDate}}/status?locationId={{locationId}}&timeSlotStart={{timeSlotStart}}&timeSlotEnd={{timeSlotEnd}}

### 7. Admin sees lifecycle details
GET {{baseUrl}}/draws/{{drawDate}}/lifecycle?locationId={{locationId}}&timeSlotStart={{timeSlotStart}}&timeSlotEnd={{timeSlotEnd}}

